*   **co2\_g\_km**: Varies by engine. C320 CDI diesel around 182-199 g/km (Source [4, 6, 7, 15]). C320 petrol V6 around 216-221 g/km (Source [3]). These are above the 175 g/km average. Averaging these. Score: -0.40.
